From 2c80ae6bfa572f6fb49fbb274c121851678f9061 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: XiangShanVU19p Port <phine-port@local>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:25:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] phine: port fpga_diff to PHINE PD-VU19P-2-LSI SOLO v3

- part: xcvu19p-fsva3824-2-e -> xcvu19p-fsva3824-1-e (11 files)
- fpga.xdc: rewrite for PHINE pins (UART BG14/BH14, 200M OSC BW37/BY37,
  PLL GC02/04/06 clocks, PUSHSW1/2, LEDs, RISC-V JTAG on GPIO header)
- ddr.xdc: regenerate for FMC2 + UV-FMCH-PDDR4DME from UG+xls pinmap
- fpga_top_debug.sv: drop SD ports, tie off to no-card state
---
